# Normalize all line endings to LF in the repository.
# This repo's own methodology (docs/METHODOLOGY.md) establishes that hashing and
# diffing must be line-ending independent; enforce that here so contributors on
# Windows don't introduce CRLF churn (git warned about exactly this on push).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts keep CRLF where consumers expect it
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary guards
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
